WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.622
Four creative principles, each matched to a problem.

00:00:03.672 --> 00:00:05.556
Constraint sparks ideas.

00:00:05.606 --> 00:00:08.587
A new idea in a familiar context breaks habits.

00:00:08.637 --> 00:00:10.922
Lean into the uncomfortable truth.

00:00:10.972 --> 00:00:13.042
And call out the category.

00:00:13.733 --> 00:00:17.787
Rexona had a tiny budget, so it earned media with Pitvertising.

00:00:17.837 --> 00:00:22.291
Kia's hybrid had nothing new, so it said nothing, brilliantly.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.934
V Energy couldn't beat Red Bull at its own game.

00:00:25.984 --> 00:00:27.750
So it called out the whole category,

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:30.166
and said one thing over and over.

00:00:30.867 --> 00:00:32.055
Use it like this:

00:00:32.105 --> 00:00:32.905
name the shape of the problem,

00:00:32.435 --> 00:00:36.177
then pick the matching principle.
